    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines, but they dont get it. they just give you scripts and tell you it gets better, but it doesnt. it doesnt make any sense to keep fighting a war that was over before it even started. you said it makes sense to find a way for the noise to stop... like, isnt there just a point where it's more logical to just let go than to keep hurting like this?",
